        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5052DT, Dumont Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Dumont Lever with Rectangular Rose has been one of the most popular leversets that we have seen in quite a while. Its contemporary and sleek design is a real attention grabber, adding sophistication to any space. The Dumont Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosette is available in some of the most sought-after finish colors including matte black, satin brass, and polished chrome. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and can fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for your interior doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DT-specifications.gif?v=1704354649\" width=\"600\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Dumont Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Dumont Door Lever with Modern Rectangle Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Dumont Leverset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DT-specifications.pdf?v=1704262369\"><b>Emtek Dumont Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Dumont Lever with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Modern Dumont Lever with Rectangular Rose has been one of the most popular leversets that we have seen in quite a while. Its contemporary and sleek design is a real attention grabber, adding sophistication to any space. The Dumont Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosette is available in some of the most sought-after finish colors including matte black, satin brass, and polished chrome. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and can fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions for your interior doors.",
                "keywords": "Dumont Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosettes, Contemporary Dumont Door Lever with Modern Rectangle Roses, Modern Dumont Leverset with Rectangular Roses, Modern Dumont Lever with Rectangular Roses, Emtek 5052DT dummy lever, EMT-5052DT, EMT-5112DT, EMT-5212DT,  Emtek 5112DT passage lever,  Emtek 5212DT privacy lever,"
